      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SPANISH BROOK (1) is in hot form after clocking a strong 22.79 victory two back then followed up with a 24.93 win at this track over 440m last time. Running fast times and looks the one to beat again. MAGICAL GEM (2) has some solid form under his belt and proved too strong last time to win by 2.5 lengths at Temora in a handy 25.85 beating Chasin' Reno. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings three times from three attempts. One of the leading chances again. GRASSCUTTER ROSS (3) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing fourth (30.71) in a Class 1 at Wanganui. Has ability and can measure up. GRASSCUTTER NICK (7) should be thereabouts after filling a top-three spot at big odds most recently.",
